  2	 * Tests for src/gui/queue/get-queue.ts — WP-005 + WP-001 (rework)
  3	 *
  4	 * Verifies:
  5	 *   AC-1 (WP-005): getQueue() returns entries with projectExists: true when the
  6	 *         project ledger file exists on disk.
  7	 *   AC-2 (WP-005): getQueue() returns entries with projectExists: false when no
  8	 *         project ledger file exists for the entry's expectedSlug.
  9	 *   AC-3 (WP-001 rework — validator): isRawQueueEntry() rejects entries whose
 10	 *         expectedSlug is an empty string or a whitespace-only string (e.g. '   ').
